{"id":"pie-that-ran-away","title":"The Pie That Ran Away","level":3,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"2ef95a3eb695099789cd5e0da2d88b4d","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["pie","tray","away","lays","round","cries","eat"],"common":["today","our","she","who","my","all"],"challenge":["after"],"before":"Look at the cover. How can a pie run away?","after":["Why did the pie run away?","How did Anastasia stop the pie?","Why did Mum put the next pie on the shed?","What do you think Dash will do next?"],"retell":[2,4,5,8,10,14],"pages":[{"text":"Today is Fun Day on our street.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"0ee2af8701051c0773b92e48ea03d0a5","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A sunny British terraced street having a street party: bunting across the road, tables with tablecloths, neighbours chatting, and a big banner across the street","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum has a big jam pie for Fun Day.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b8b075e8211b3fb6e555919da409024d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum proudly carries a huge golden pie with a criss-cross crust out of the front door, steam rising.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"She puts it on a tray to cool.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d9982cfbbd9c071e7ceb7ae82cbb9d15","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The pie sits on a tray on the front windowsill.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash sniffs. Mmm! He creeps into the pie.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"476316b1340e5910d3fec920e8a51b1d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash lifts the edge of the crust and slides inside the pie.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then the pie gets up and runs away!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2000b86b8c36cf844c2eb9fb4b1acf0c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The pie has little turquoise-green dinosaur feet sticking out underneath and is running off the tray and along the pavement, crumbs flying.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia run after it.","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"Stop that pie!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"b19259417be025fe3770853fe19dee6a","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia chase the running pie down the street, past surprised neighbours.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The pie runs past a dog. The dog runs after it too!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3de3364a7b08d606c3f6f3e301a9e5b5","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A fluffy dog joins the chase with its tongue out.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The pie runs round and round a tree.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9a19a7179918d538f7bc892a20433491","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A circular chase round a tree in the street: the pie, the dog and the children all running in a loop, getting dizzy.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia has a plan. She lays a trail of sweets.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"5081eab8d6df28c4809786c29636a8ee","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia drops colourful sweets in a line along the pavement, leading to a picnic blanket.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The pie stops to eat a sweet. Munch!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9b987884952ff44b1c574cad61dd88ae","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The pie has stopped at a sweet, and a little dinosaur mouth peeks out from under the crust to munch it.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan lifts the top. Who is in the pie?","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"7dfbcb4a5c2cb292184359f5e4245a80","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan carefully lifts the criss-cross crust like a lid.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It is Dash, with jam on his cheeks!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"7408dab2bd7f12ed9f4734a1b6ca8eac","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash sits in the pie dish covered in red jam, licking his fingers with a guilty grin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum cries, \"My pie!\" Then all the street claps and cheers.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d6189e5af9a1950100972e09ca597ba4","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum has her hands on her cheeks.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum puts the next pie up high... on top of the shed!","bubble":{"who":"dash","name":"Dash","text":"Yum!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"ca3c743f81bfdf96cbe03cecd491249e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"In the back garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed), a new pie sits on the shed roof.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}